  "project_description": "This module does exactly what the title says - it minifies the source HTML before the data is sent to the browser. The module hooks into the very end of the rendering process to make sure it minifies everything.\n\n This module plays well with page compression, caching and Bigpipe (D8+)\n\n The companion module Minify JS module minifies JS.\n\n Support this module: \n \n Translate this module at localize.drupal.org \n Buy me a beer (or whatever)",
